     This is the exact particle-completion publication boundary. It is reached from base particle
   lifecycle paths as well as Lux ticking, so completion callbacks cannot be assumed nested only
   under ProcessLuxParticleSystemComponentTick. Delegate-before-deactivation/destroy ordering is
   semantic.
   
