   1. Select and validate the UObject outer.
   2. Construct the exact native ULuxParticleSystemComponent class through
   StaticConstructObject_Internal.
   3. Set auto-destruction and creation flags.
   4. Assign the particle template, reset component state, and return the live component.
   
